{%- comment -%}
  Heartside's own lines in the page head (Krish, 3 Nov 2026: "the favicons don't even show").
  Helio wrote one 32 px icon and an empty theme colour, which phones, home screens and search
  results pass over, so a tab or a result showed nothing. This writes the approved icon (since
  10 Nov 2026 the brand-v5 dachshund with the heart letter, design/brand-v5/, byte copies in
  assets/hs-favicon-*.png) at every size they ask for, the touch icon, a manifest and the page colour. The theme push's "head_heartside" option
  renders it before </head> and switches Helio's icon and colour lines off
  (.github/scripts/head-heartside.mjs, which can --restore them). /favicon.ico is a store redirect
  to design/brand-v4/favicon.ico in Shopify Files.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- comment -%}
  Journey mode from the head (transitions report and review, 5 Nov: the class that steps the store's header aside was
  set by the gift page's own snippet, after the header had been parsed, so a phone could paint the header for a
  moment as the gift page opened). This only sets the class, from the same journey record the snippet reads; the
  snippet's inline check and hs-journey-choose.js still decide, and if this page has no journey panel at all the
  class comes off again as soon as the page is parsed, so a wrong guess can never hide a product page. Without
  ?journey=1 only this product's own key counts, as in hs2.js journey() (5 Nov review: another gift's key once turned
  a normal gift page into the panel); where the head cannot see the product, only ?journey=1 counts.
{%- endcomment -%}
<style>html.hs-jm-on .shopify-section-group-header-group,html.hs-jm-on .header-group,html.hs-jm-on .shopify-section-group-footer-group,html.hs-jm-on .footer-group{display:none!important}html.hs-jm-on body{background:#FBF7F3}</style>
<script>(function(d){try{var m=/^\/products\/([^/?#]+)/.exec(location.pathname),s=window.sessionStorage;if(!m||/[?&]redo=/.test(location.search))return;var j=(JSON.parse(s.getItem('hs2-review')||'{}')||{}).hs_journey;if(!j||j.mode!=='photo-first'||!j.t||Date.now()-j.t>6*36e5)return;var mine=(j.queue||[]).some(function(q){var x=/\/products\/([^/?#]+)/.exec(q.url||'');return x&&x[1]===m[1]});var on=/[?&]journey=1(&|$)/.test(location.search),pid={{ product.id | default: 0 | json }};if(!on&&pid)on=s.getItem('hs2-journey-on:'+pid)===String(j.t);if(!on||!mine)return;d.classList.add('hs-jm-on');document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',function(){if(!document.querySelector('[data-hs-jm]'))d.classList.remove('hs-jm-on')})}catch(e){}})(document.documentElement);</script>
